<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table A.1: </span>Comprehensive comparison of generative models across four standard benchmarks. Best results are highlighted in <span id="A1.T1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBF5FF;">blue</span>.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
